sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Patient
    participant FE as Patient Portal
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over P,DB: Login
    P->>FE: Enter credentials
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/login
    BE->>DB: Validate user
    DB-->>BE: User record
    BE-->>FE: JWT token
    FE-->>P: Dashboard access

    Note over P,DB: Update Profile
    P->>FE: Edit profile
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/update-profile
    BE->>DB: Update user
    BE-->>FE: Success

    Note over P,DB: Fill Medical History
    P->>FE: Submit medical history
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/medical-history
    BE->>DB: Save history
    BE-->>FE: Success

    Note over P,DB: View Doctors & Search by Clinic
    P->>FE: Browse / filter doctors
    FE->>BE: GET /api/doctor/list
    BE->>DB: Query doctors
    DB-->>BE: Doctor list
    BE-->>FE: Results
    FE-->>P: Display doctors

    Note over P,DB: Book Appointment
    P->>FE: Select slot & payment
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/book-appointment
    BE->>DB: Create appointment
    BE-->>FE: Confirmation
    FE-->>P: Booking success

    Note over P,DB: View & Cancel Appointments
    P->>FE: View appointment history
    FE->>BE: GET /api/user/appointments
    BE->>DB: Fetch appointments
    BE-->>FE: List
    P->>FE: Cancel appointment
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/cancel-appointment
    BE->>DB: Update status

    Note over P,DB: View Prescriptions
    P->>FE: Request prescription
    FE->>BE: POST /api/user/get-prescription
    BE->>DB: Fetch prescription
    BE-->>FE: Prescription data
